"text": "Your friend stole your last beer and he's running away with it. So you sit on a wooden beam between two wheels and kick the ground to chase him. Clever! But your legs give up after one block, so you bolt pedals onto the front wheel. Except you're still slower than his fat ass, so you make the front wheel fucking huge. But you hit one tiny rock and fly face first over the handlebars, so you shrink the wheels and drive the back one with the chain. Now one turn of the pedals spins the back wheel three times, launching you forward. Genius! Except the wooden wheels shake your balls like a blender, so you wrap them in rubber tubes full of air. Now your friend never keeps a beer for more than five seconds.",
